# Local/volume SQLite state must never enter the image build context. The
# production service uses PostgreSQL (or a mounted DATA_ROOT in fallback
# environments); copying a developer database would leak data and invalidate
# the closed-beta immutability boundary.
nexyfab.db*
# knowledge-crawler holds ~323MB of RAG corpus/index data and is NOT needed in
# the image (the runner only copies scripts/drawing-to-3d + engineering-core).
scripts/knowledge-crawler/
